WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Mid-Autumn Festival in the previous life

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,120
I'm in a resettlement camp

3
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,400
Not even enough to eat

4
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,880
In this life, I will be with you silently

5
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,080
Of course we have to have a good holiday

6
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,460
First refrigerate the mixed ice skin for little Zen Cat

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,780
This is what mom uses to make mooncakes

8
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,860
Why are you still eating secretly?

9
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,520
Why don't you eat it secretly?

10
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:22,420
Help mom more

11
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,620
Done

12
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:26,430
Mom, it’s a great holiday!

13
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:30,030
I have to share Han Lu with Han Lu and Aunt Zhou.

14
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,190
I sent you some boxes of mooncakes

15
00:00:31,190 --> 00:00:32,110
Hanging on the door

16
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:36,630
Remember to take

17
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,110
What about the ink room?

18
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,310
Eat and drink

19
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,590
Accompanying me silently

20
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:45,650
This day is much better than the last life.

21
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:46,690
Who is the bad luck?

22
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:47,610
I'm injured and lying on the bed

23
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:49,010
How dare you steal someone behind my back?

24
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:51,130
It's Fang He and Liu Dabao

25
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,850
They said you were useless and bullied me, talking nonsense.

26
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:56,250
My fever-reducing medicine was given to you by them.

27
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:57,410
What did you find for me?
